        doc:part_6,
        doc:participation_1 ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "On 19 July 2007, the Fund decided to establish two economic and commercial units: one for Viva TV and the other for Radio Viva."^^xsd:string,
        "On 30 June 2009, a valuation report issued by TSKB determined"^^xsd:string,
        "On 9 May 2006, a debt liquidation protocol ( Borç Tasfiye Protokolü , hereinafter referred to as “the Liquidation Protocol”) was signed between the Fund (as creditor) and the Erol Aksoy Group (as debtor)"^^xsd:string .

